{"c":[{"name":"20261016T195949Z-c42d3773b4d4c55f","text":"sr-initialize owner: engine under .../cache/<mkt>/<plugin>/<ver> (or Claude synced/) is claude/cursor; any checkout load (--plugin-dir, Cursor plugins/local, mirror) is dev. Agent shells never get plugin-root env; Claude substitutes exact ${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT} in skill text.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261016T215531Z-8195092923e19a0d","text":"sr-initialize owner: path decides in default plugins dirs (.claude/plugins/cache|synced, .cursor/plugins/cache); elsewhere CURSOR_PLUGIN_ROOT holding the engine is cursor, else Claude Code asks. Substituted CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT is not proof: --plugin-dir substitutes checkouts.","type":"note"}]}
